# Per-run records are history; the round log is the history that matters and the
# latest-<profile>.json pointers are what the next run compares against.
# Everything else here (sweeps, audits, calibration snapshots) is committed on purpose.
20*-*.json
# Older timestamped sweep and probe snapshots. One stable snapshot per kind is
# committed; the round log carries the history.
sweep-*-20*.json
probe-*-20*.json
